            "review_text": "mick g\n2 contributions\n0\nRibs wings and cold beer -in the heart of Saigon\nJan 2025 • Family\nGreat food and cocktails - nice cold beer.\nWe had Chicken Wings, sandwiches, and burgers and all was really fresh and tasty. Service was the best I’ve had in Vietnam by a mile. Friendly, and fast! Highly recommend this bar for some western style BBQ joy!\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten January 8, 2025",
