            "review_title": "Review at Mulligans SaiGon",
            "review_text": "Bob H\nNoordwijk, The Netherlands424 contributions\n0\nBest Ribeye in town\nAug 2023 • Solo\nEnded up here on the recommendation of friends. A real café where you can enjoy an excellent meal while enjoying a drink, all for a very affordable price. Behind the desk are extremely friendly girls who make everything even more pleasant and cheer you up.\nI had Ribeye, asparagus and mashed potatoes, but the menu has many other tasty European dishes, including pizza. Although this is not in the entertainment area of Ho Chi Minh, it is more than worth the drive. And if you come between 2:00 PM and 6:00 PM, it is also happy hour.\nRead more\nShow original\nWritten August 12, 2023",
