            "review_text": "junebiswas\nBangkok, Thailand409 contributions\n0\nSuch a great vibe\nAug 2023 • Couples\nOut of all the places we went to in HCM, Mulligan's was definitely our favorite. Right from the owner Mac's warm hospitality to the excellent meats that are smoked in-house to the friendly staff and patrons, we loved our time here. We had the bbq meat platter which was really delicious and washed it down with a couple of beers. The regulars here are also very friendly and gave us a lot of information about HCM and other must visit places. We had a truly great time here and will be back real soon!\nRead more\nWritten August 1, 2023",
