            "review_title": "Review at Mulligans SaiGon",
            "review_text": "Shaun\nAshbourne, Ireland5 contributions\n0\nA wonderful place\nJul 2023 • Friends\nMulligans in Saigon, Hoi Chi Ming, Vietnam, truly exceeded all our expectations during our visit. From the moment we stepped in, Mac, the owner, extended his warmest greetings and made us feel like old friends. His genuine hospitality added an extra touch to our dining experience, and we appreciated the personal touch he brought to the place. \n\nOver the course of two weeks, we found ourselves coming back to Mulligans time and again to watch the Gaelic and Hurling and just enjoy a drink with our friends. The food was a culinary delight, and every dish we tried was simply incredible. We especially loved their meat dishes, and it's evident why they have a successful meat business with such high-quality offerings.\n\nBut the real highlight of our time at Mulligans was Mac and the staff behind the bar. Their warm, welcoming personalities made each visit feel like a celebration. They were more than just bartenders; they were like friends, sharing stories and laughter throughout the evenings.\n\nMulligans truly embodies the essence of a perfect dining and drinking experience - great food, warm hospitality, and a friendly ambiance. We are grateful to Mac and the entire team for making our time in Saigon so memorable. We cannot wait to return and relish the great atmosphere and craic at Mulligans once again. Thank you, Mac, you have created a gem in the heart of Hoi Chi Ming!\nRead more\nWritten August 1, 2023",
