            "review_text": "Peter Stone\nBangkok, Thailand35 contributions\n0\nANTIQUE DISTRICT CLASSIC PUB\nFeb 2023 • Solo\nAwe the joy to have experienced Mulligan’s fine dining and drinking while in HCMC… Wow what a place to see a genuinely amazing Vietnamese staff serve some of the finest western (and some eastern:) food available in District 1. I believe the owner/proprietors names both start with an “M,”regardlessly, they’re always around managing the televisions and general environment for guests. They also have a huge clientele of local businessmen who are friendly and have a wealth of information about SE Asia. I will continue to visit Mulligan’s every time I’m in HCMC and remain loyal. Cheers!!!\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten February 16, 2023",
