            "review_title": "Review at Mulligans SaiGon",
            "review_text": "jhpmurphy M\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam14 contributions\n0\nGreat food. Friendly staff and clientele. Attentive management.\nJan 2022\nI visited Mulligan's to try out their sausage platter (Delicious!). Even though it was mid-afternoon, there were quite a few customers at the bar, ordering food and drink, chatting up the staff, and enjoying each other's company. Mulligan's menu offers a wide variety of choices, breakfast favorites (Served all day) , barbecue ribs, Vietnamese fusion dishes, corned beef, pizza, and pasta dishes. \nI look forward to dining at Mulligan's again to try their famous pork ribs and pizza.\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten January 17, 2022",
