            "review_title": "Review at Mulligans SaiGon",
            "review_text": "Raghu\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam4 contributions\n0\nTraditional Pub in Saigon\nMay 2021 • Friends\nFinally an Incredible Pub in downtown Saigon! Traditional Pub style bar where you can actually belly up to the bar. Happy Hour everyday from 2-6pm for good inexpensive beers. \n\nHomemade food that that includes all of the great pub food that I have missed for so long time. Htomemade pizza, sandwichs: brisket sandwich, chicken club, burger, qll day breakfast, ribs, sausages, and even a loco moco. \n\nPork Chop dinner with mashed taters and asparagus is my favorite thing on the menu. I get it blackened. They have a retail store in the back that sells all locally made products amd all of their meats. \n\nThey smoke all of their own meats in house and have a different Saturday special every week. Half price wings on Tuesdays. \n\nThis is my favorite place in Vietnam. Great food, Great prices and pub atmosphere. HUGE selection of beer and alcohol\n \nFeel like I am at a bar back in New York\nRead more\nWritten May 25, 2021",
