            "review_title": "Review at Mulligans SaiGon",
            "review_text": "vespascooterguy\nSaigon16 contributions\n0\nFriendly atmosphere with awesome food\nApr 2021 • Friends\nWanted to check out this Irish pub with a name like Mulligan's. It was much more than a pub, more like \" Cheers \" from the old tv show. The owner really enjoys his place and appreciates new folks coming by. It is on the smaller side so gives it a warm feeling. By American standards, the place is overstaffed with friendly Saigon ladies. What surprised me the most , it's not your ordinary pub grub. Quality food, I really enjoyed my ribs.\nDefinitely want to try more items on the menu, I will be back!!\nRead more\nWritten May 10, 2021",
