            "review_title": "Review at Mulligans SaiGon",
            "review_text": "Dave\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam65 contributions\n0\nNeighborhood bar with Gourmet eats\nMay 2021 • Friends\nMulligans is a neighborhood bar that specializes in food. They smoke meats on the roof and retail premium cuts to restaurants around Saigon. Suffice to say, the food is great! If you are looking for a place to call home with friendly staff, good eats and tasty drinks, this is the place. My favs are the beef stew, chicken wings and loco moco. Yum.\nWritten May 7, 2021",
